WEBVTT

00:12.490 --> 00:16.740
<i>Karane the tsundere, worried about 
her inability to be frank and sincere,</i>

00:16.740 --> 00:22.430
<i>took Kusuri's De-Tsundere-fy Medicine 
and lost her tsundere nature.</i>

00:22.430 --> 00:26.720
<i>But after our protagonist 
who loves Karane, Kakaro—</i>

00:26.720 --> 00:30.280
<i>I mean, Rentaro, and the family 
make their feelings for her clear,</i>

00:30.280 --> 00:33.150
<i>she decides to go back to her tsundere self.</i>

00:33.150 --> 00:39.890
<i>This pure-love harem romcom, started by 
God's twist of fate, reaches its climax!</i>

00:41.200 --> 00:44.450
Make sure you all watch till the very end!

00:44.450 --> 00:48.020
And you've been shameless till 
the very end, like you're not the root cause!

01:01.740 --> 01:06.950
<b>The 100 Girlfriends
Who Really, Really, Really, Really,
REALLY Love You</b>

01:07.780 --> 01:10.620
Karane

01:07.780 --> 01:10.620
as the
Tsundere Princess

01:10.620 --> 01:12.910
Mei

01:10.620 --> 01:12.910
Demonstration
Tea-Time Prep

01:12.910 --> 01:14.500
Hakari

01:12.910 --> 01:14.500
Suggestive Weight-Loss
Running

01:14.500 --> 01:15.750
Kurumi

01:14.500 --> 01:15.750
Ate all of the
school store's bread

01:15.750 --> 01:17.250
Mimimi

01:15.750 --> 01:17.250
(Getting ready)
Two hours later

01:18.430 --> 01:20.960
Nano

01:18.430 --> 01:20.960
Robot that
exercises for her

01:20.960 --> 01:23.380
Shizuka

01:20.960 --> 01:23.380
Has 365 book
recommendations
this week

01:23.380 --> 01:25.680
Kusuri

01:23.380 --> 01:25.680
Has newly developed
drug that gives
you sweet dreams

01:25.680 --> 01:26.340
Hahari

01:25.680 --> 01:26.340
Chairperson's Address
"Education" and "Love"

01:26.340 --> 01:27.010
Iku

01:26.340 --> 01:27.010
Has been doing
push-ups since yesterday

01:27.010 --> 01:28.560
Meme

01:27.010 --> 01:28.560
Customized Plushy-
Rentaro-kun

01:28.680 --> 01:33.400
<b>Rentaro-kun Appreciation Opening</b>

01:36.150 --> 01:37.820
Meme-san added ears

01:36.150 --> 01:37.820
and a tail for you!

01:43.450 --> 01:45.490
<b>Rentaro-kun (& Others) Appreciation Opening</b>

02:18.820 --> 02:20.490
Is it true, Rentaro?

02:20.950 --> 02:24.290
Did you figure out a way to bring 
Karane's tsundere nature back?

02:24.290 --> 02:24.870
Yeah.

02:25.640 --> 02:29.750
I thought of this plan while spending 
last night at the Hanazonos'.

02:30.000 --> 02:32.330
I expect something indecent.

02:32.960 --> 02:34.000
Why?

02:34.340 --> 02:38.470
Everyone is capable of generating 
at least some Tsunderays.

02:38.470 --> 02:39.260
Yep, yep.

02:39.630 --> 02:44.510
But Karane isn't presently capable of 
generating as much as she used to.

02:41.180 --> 02:42.430
<b>sparkle</b>

02:44.930 --> 02:51.650
Which made me think that maybe all of us 
could generate and channel them into her.

02:53.110 --> 02:55.900
I-Is that even possible?

02:56.150 --> 02:59.400
In theory, aye... probably.

02:59.700 --> 03:01.450
If things go well... maybe.

03:01.450 --> 03:04.410
Well, <i>someone's</i> not confident. 
And I mean you—you're not confident.

03:04.740 --> 03:07.750
First, we'll all take 
the De-Tsundere-fy Medicine.

03:07.750 --> 03:09.410
Are we really bulldozing through this?

03:09.710 --> 03:15.170
The Tsunderays expelled from 
our bodies will fill up the area.

03:15.630 --> 03:19.470
Assuming Karane's original 
Tsunderays were 100 percent,

03:19.470 --> 03:25.370
we only need to give off 
10 percent each to match that.

03:25.930 --> 03:29.640
If Karane-sama takes 
the Tsunderefying Medicine then,

03:29.640 --> 03:31.810
she'll absorb the Tsunderays in the air...

03:31.810 --> 03:34.860
...and meet her recommended 
intake of Tsunderays!

03:34.860 --> 03:36.320
It's not collagen, aye.

03:36.650 --> 03:39.190
But there just one problem.

03:39.690 --> 03:45.620
The Tsunderays of us ten 
may not harmonize into one.

03:45.620 --> 03:48.910
If we force them into her body, 
then in the worst case...

03:49.540 --> 03:51.210
it might explode.

03:51.210 --> 03:52.580
That's one gory firework!

03:53.070 --> 03:56.340
It's too risky for Karane 
in her weakened state.

03:56.340 --> 04:04.340
So I'll take both drugs, combine all our 
Tsunderays, and filter them through to her.

04:04.680 --> 04:05.510
In other words...

04:11.730 --> 04:13.690
I'll do what Goku did with the Spirit Bomb.

04:13.690 --> 04:15.100
Literally the same thing!

04:15.520 --> 04:19.190
I want to be Chi-Chi, Goku's wife.

04:19.190 --> 04:21.360
And I want to handle all your T-Ts.

04:21.690 --> 04:25.160
Karane will absorb the Tsunderays.

04:25.160 --> 04:27.700
She'll essentially be the Majin Buu.

04:27.700 --> 04:28.830
So she dies?

04:29.150 --> 04:31.580
You've been making some 
beautifully biting remarks.

04:31.580 --> 04:34.160
Sorry to make you do this in my place.

04:34.500 --> 04:40.000
<i>"Halt. Will Kurumi be safe in this scenario?"</i>

04:40.000 --> 04:44.170
True. Kurumi's pretty tsundere herself.

04:44.170 --> 04:49.010
Kurumi's personality shaped by her 
Hangry Hungerays, so she be fine.

04:49.010 --> 04:50.930
Stop making all of us sound tropey.

04:51.220 --> 04:54.940
She's trying so hard to 
fill the hole left by Karane-san.

04:54.940 --> 04:57.230
I wish she'd fill my hole instead.

04:58.110 --> 04:59.060
In all likelihood,

04:59.060 --> 05:03.070
generating Tsunderays won't be 
as easy as it sounds.

05:04.190 --> 05:06.570
This will be hard on all of us.

05:06.910 --> 05:09.580
Are you still willing to help?

05:12.330 --> 05:14.250
Of course!

05:12.330 --> 05:14.250
Bring on the pain!

05:12.330 --> 05:14.250
Hell yeah!

05:12.330 --> 05:14.250
You can count 
on Mommy!

05:12.330 --> 05:14.250
I will, indeed!

05:12.330 --> 05:14.250
Obviously, aye.

05:12.330 --> 05:14.250
Your wish 
is my command.

05:12.330 --> 05:14.250
<i>"You have 
my word, bossman."</i>

05:14.250 --> 05:16.710
An even bigger parade of speech tics than S1E4!

05:17.710 --> 05:22.460
<i>And so, Operation Everyone-
Generates-Tsunderays,</i>

05:22.460 --> 05:25.720
<b>Tsunde-Rave</b>

05:22.840 --> 05:25.720
<i>or the Tsunde-Rave for short, began!</i>

05:23.760 --> 05:25.720
<b>*as named by Hahari.</b>

05:26.180 --> 05:30.220
I-It's not like I wanna make babies 
with you or anything, okay?!

05:30.510 --> 05:34.480
Gah! The very first one 
hit like a ton of bricks!

05:34.480 --> 05:39.100
Oh, sorry, I was just acting! 
I would bang all day and night...

05:39.270 --> 05:41.360
<b>hngh!! ♥</b>

05:39.360 --> 05:41.360
A refreshing new take on Hakari!

05:41.520 --> 05:44.230
<b>hngh!! ♥</b>

05:41.730 --> 05:44.230
Now that's our Rentaro-kun!

05:49.880 --> 05:51.140
<i>What is this?</i>

05:51.140 --> 05:55.160
<i>I feel so fatigued, 
like I just ran at a full sprint.</i>

05:55.160 --> 05:59.170
<i>Is this what it takes to produce Tsunderays?</i>

06:01.130 --> 06:03.590
Don't look at me like that!

06:03.590 --> 06:06.260
This is... nothing!

06:07.930 --> 06:10.010
It's not like I'm drained or anything, okay?

06:10.260 --> 06:12.300
Your turn, ladies.

06:13.760 --> 06:19.850
<i>"I-It isn't like I see you 
as my prince or anything, all right?"</i>

06:20.680 --> 06:25.860
I-It's not like eating with you makes for 
the best meals ever or anything, okay?

06:26.770 --> 06:31.370
I-It's not as if I wish to serve you 
with all my being, okay?

06:32.320 --> 06:37.040
I-I-It's not like I want you 
to find me or anything, okay?

06:37.850 --> 06:42.210
It's not like I'd love the pain 
if you pounded my butt with a bat, okay?

06:42.790 --> 06:47.130
I-It's not like I want to change 
your diapers or anything, okay?

06:47.550 --> 06:51.760
I-It's not like Kusuri made this for you, aye?

06:51.760 --> 06:52.550
Thanks!

06:52.850 --> 06:56.770
I-It isn't as if I am not 
indeed beautiful, okay?

06:56.770 --> 06:57.560
Right!

06:58.060 --> 07:00.690
It's not like spending time 
with you has any meaning.

07:03.630 --> 07:04.980
That's a non-dere!

07:04.980 --> 07:06.610
I-I apologize.

07:06.610 --> 07:09.320
I'll try harder to strike 
a more efficient balance.

07:09.820 --> 07:13.410
1-1t's n0t l1ke I l1ke y0u 0r anyth1ng, 0kay?

07:15.410 --> 07:20.000
<i>The plan was far harder than 
what it looks like onscreen,</i>

07:20.000 --> 07:25.630
<i>but all of them fought through it 
for the sake of their beloved Karane.</i>

07:25.960 --> 07:27.550
<i>And finally...</i>

07:28.380 --> 07:29.900
Th-There we go!

07:29.900 --> 07:33.640
This is the same size as 
the Tsunderays Karane lost yesterday.

07:34.180 --> 07:37.760
<i>Now all I need to do is hand it 
over to Karane... and yet!</i>

07:38.390 --> 07:40.020
<i>I can't...</i>

07:40.020 --> 07:42.390
<i>I can't control it at all!</i>

07:43.100 --> 07:45.310
<i>It's taking all I have to keep it together!</i>

07:45.940 --> 07:49.440
<i>This is what ten people's worth of 
Tsunderays is like!</i>

07:49.440 --> 07:52.650
I'm so embarrassed.

07:49.440 --> 07:52.650
I hate you!

07:49.440 --> 07:52.650
"I'm scared!"

07:49.440 --> 07:52.650
I don't want to.

07:49.440 --> 07:52.650
I'm hungry!

07:49.440 --> 07:52.650
I hate it all!

07:52.650 --> 07:55.780
The emotions of ten different people 
are going wild in there.

07:56.140 --> 07:58.540
How do I unify all these feelings into one?

07:58.830 --> 08:01.910
R-Rentaro-kun, don't push yourself.

08:01.910 --> 08:02.580
It's...

08:02.580 --> 08:05.060
It's not like I'm doing this 
for you or anything, Karane!

08:06.540 --> 08:09.710
S-Sorry, Karane! That just slipped out!

08:09.710 --> 08:12.050
I-I know. It's okay.

08:12.320 --> 08:15.720
<i>Why'd I just say something 
I didn't mean one bit?</i>

08:15.720 --> 08:16.300
<i>Wait...</i>

08:16.810 --> 08:19.560
<i>Was I affected by this 
massive amount of Tsunderays?</i>

08:19.980 --> 08:21.060
<i>So this...</i>

08:21.560 --> 08:24.560
<b>The Force of "Tsundere"</b>

08:21.890 --> 08:23.770
<i>This is the force of "Tsundere."</i>

08:24.850 --> 08:28.820
<i>Is this the kind of impulse Karane 
was fighting every day?</i>

08:30.110 --> 08:31.150
Yeah...

08:31.570 --> 08:34.070
You really are amazing, Karane.

08:34.660 --> 08:36.950
<i>All this time, she's had this weighing on her,</i>

08:36.950 --> 08:40.490
<i>and she still overcame it 
to tell me she loved me.</i>

08:41.080 --> 08:45.210
I... I love you too, Aijo.

08:44.750 --> 08:45.830
<i>Karane...</i>

08:45.210 --> 08:47.130
Please go out with me.

08:46.580 --> 08:47.460
<i>Karane...</i>

08:47.130 --> 08:50.880
I love Rentaro the most 
in the whole wide world!

08:48.130 --> 08:49.090
Karane...

08:49.460 --> 08:50.340
Karane...

08:50.880 --> 08:51.920
Karane...

08:50.880 --> 08:53.670
I really, really, really, really, 
<i>really</i> love him!

08:52.510 --> 08:53.670
<i>Karane!</i>

08:54.840 --> 08:55.760
Karane...

08:58.350 --> 08:59.640
I love you.

09:11.440 --> 09:12.480
Karane!

09:13.620 --> 09:16.320
Whether she can absorb it all...

09:16.740 --> 09:20.580
depend on how much she 
want to go back to normal!

09:22.790 --> 09:23.830
Come on...

09:24.200 --> 09:25.210
Karane!

09:26.160 --> 09:28.580
You can do this, Karane!

09:28.580 --> 09:30.960
Sumo Kusuri outta the ring again, aye!

09:30.960 --> 09:33.590
You're the only home run butt-hitter!

09:33.590 --> 09:35.470
We lack fighting strength without you.

09:35.470 --> 09:37.220
I can't control them all myself. I need you.

09:37.510 --> 09:40.350
K-K-K-K-Karane-san...

09:40.350 --> 09:44.220
Come back and pound me with your fists again!

09:44.500 --> 09:48.350
We need your honorable 
tsundereness to be whole.

09:48.650 --> 09:52.480
You were the kind of tsundere 
that I deemed beautiful, you know!

09:52.480 --> 09:57.830
Yes, I could imagine the old you crocheting.

09:57.830 --> 09:59.740
Please crochet with me!

10:00.030 --> 10:02.240
Come back to us,

10:02.240 --> 10:03.450
Karane-san!

10:03.450 --> 10:07.330
You can do it, Karane!

10:18.430 --> 10:19.550
Karane...

10:24.510 --> 10:27.480
Are you back to being tsundere, Karane?

10:29.850 --> 10:30.560
It's...

10:31.730 --> 10:34.480
It's not like I'm tsundere or anything, okay?!

10:34.480 --> 10:37.440
She's tsundere!

10:35.480 --> 10:37.440
huggg!!

10:37.440 --> 10:40.200
Hey! Wh-Wha...

10:40.200 --> 10:42.070
Quit being all clingy!

10:42.070 --> 10:43.950
That's our Karane!

10:44.280 --> 10:50.580
Tsundere! Comeback!

10:51.460 --> 10:52.460
Everyone.

10:53.380 --> 10:55.960
Th... Tha...

10:57.800 --> 10:59.090
Thanks.

11:02.340 --> 11:04.930
No... she's not fully recovered yet.

11:04.930 --> 11:06.810
She's still Two Face...

11:06.810 --> 11:07.850
Who dis?

11:07.850 --> 11:08.810
<i>"A false dawn."</i>

11:08.810 --> 11:10.560
That's not the Karane-senpai I know.

11:10.560 --> 11:11.400
The pain...

11:11.400 --> 11:12.230
Unacceptable.

11:12.730 --> 11:15.230
You're never getting my affection again!

11:17.730 --> 11:20.200
Rentaro... I love you so much...

11:20.200 --> 11:21.820
<i>She changed her tune quick.</i>

11:21.820 --> 11:22.990
<i>She's too easy.</i>

11:23.370 --> 11:27.240
<i>All's well that ends well, 
but we're not done just yet.</i>

11:27.240 --> 11:29.620
<i>To be continued just a little bit more.</i>

11:31.430 --> 11:34.020
You should've seen Rentaro-kun back then.

11:34.020 --> 11:37.880
He helped not only me, 
but also the other couple.

11:38.190 --> 11:43.200
His pure-hearted beauty made me say, 
"I love you. Please go out with me."

11:43.200 --> 11:45.700
And he accepted it with such grace.

11:45.700 --> 11:47.370
Squee!

11:47.370 --> 11:49.020
A-As for me...

11:49.020 --> 11:51.560
After I told him I loved him,

11:51.560 --> 11:56.570
he looked at me straight 
and said he loved me too.

11:56.570 --> 11:58.230
Squee!

11:58.230 --> 12:01.780
But I got so embarrassed, 
used misdirection to hide,

12:02.110 --> 12:05.740
and nearly ended the show one episode early.

12:05.740 --> 12:07.530
C-Close call.

12:07.910 --> 12:08.910
I must ask...

12:08.910 --> 12:12.460
And I know it's a little belated 
after all this talk,

12:13.460 --> 12:18.670
<b>The 100 Girlfriends Who Really,  Really,
Really, Really, REALLY Love You Vol. 5</b>

12:13.540 --> 12:17.340
but should Meme-san and I really be here?

12:17.340 --> 12:22.130
I-I'm pretty sure we hadn't appeared yet.

12:22.670 --> 12:25.930
It's fine! You two totally belong here!

12:25.930 --> 12:29.100
Y-Yeah! I think you two 
were here in the manga too!

12:29.100 --> 12:30.640
No, I'm sure of it!

12:30.640 --> 12:33.520
If any problems arise due to 
rearranging manga chapters,

12:33.520 --> 12:36.190
it's all the anime director's 
responsibility, aye!

12:37.700 --> 12:39.650
These are memories that shouldn't exist...

12:39.650 --> 12:42.690
<i>"Don't go there. Don't open Pandora's Box."</i>

12:42.990 --> 12:43.820
A...

12:44.150 --> 12:48.370
Anyway, romantic gossip never grows old, huh?

12:48.370 --> 12:50.580
We're all talking about the same guy, though.

12:52.000 --> 12:54.500
So this is what it means 
when they say, "We stan a king."

12:54.500 --> 12:57.330
Really not something we should be 
saying about a boyfriend.

12:57.330 --> 13:00.180
<i>"B-But... 'I love you,' eh?"</i>

13:00.180 --> 13:03.130
<i>"I haven't said those words in eons."</i>

13:03.130 --> 13:04.970
Mm? That so?

13:05.230 --> 13:11.640
True... I keep thinking it, 
but I don't say it too often.

13:12.430 --> 13:14.730
I'm too shy to say it out loud.

13:15.000 --> 13:18.610
I keep assuming he knows 
without me having to tell him.

13:18.610 --> 13:20.980
When have you ever been shy?

13:21.360 --> 13:24.860
I wub you! Mwah!

13:25.130 --> 13:28.620
That's just because my love for Rentaro-chan 
and my love for you all are different.

13:28.620 --> 13:29.870
How are they different, exactly?

13:29.870 --> 13:34.580
My love for Rentaro-chan makes me want 
to marry him, whereas my love for you...

13:35.540 --> 13:37.210
makes me want to marry you all.

13:37.210 --> 13:39.130
They sound the same to me, 
Ms. Stacked Overflow.

13:39.380 --> 13:44.970
A failure to communicate is 
the leading cause of relationship failure.

13:44.970 --> 13:48.720
Yes, it's important to verbalize 
your feelings for your partner.

13:48.720 --> 13:50.350
Right...

13:50.350 --> 13:53.140
If I keep hiding when he says he loves me,

13:53.140 --> 13:55.520
I'll never be able to tell him 
I feel the same way.

13:55.520 --> 13:59.940
<i>"Such is the fate of us timid peoples."</i>

14:01.060 --> 14:04.780
So even love requires the stoicism 
to work yourself to death.

14:05.150 --> 14:06.570
I see it now.

14:06.570 --> 14:08.530
I'll be damned if it does.

14:09.200 --> 14:11.660
Sorry, I was helping a teacher out.

14:12.240 --> 14:16.290
What was he thinking, trying to 
move 10,000 boxes alone?

14:17.160 --> 14:19.040
What's the matter?

14:22.280 --> 14:23.670
Rentaro!

14:23.670 --> 14:26.970
Kusuri loves you, aye!

14:26.970 --> 14:27.420
Huh?

14:27.420 --> 14:32.680
Kusuri love how you always listen 
to endless talk about drug R&D.

14:33.010 --> 14:37.560
And how you personally test out random 
medicine with unknown effect.

14:37.560 --> 14:38.850
A voluntary lab rat?!

14:38.850 --> 14:41.810
Stop that at once! All of that adds up!

14:42.150 --> 14:46.990
Thanks for always making Kusuri happy, Rentaro.

14:46.990 --> 14:48.190
Kusuri really love you, aye!

14:48.450 --> 14:49.700
<b>phwoosh!!</b>

14:49.990 --> 14:51.620
That'z... tz-tz-tz...

14:51.620 --> 14:54.870
Untz, untz, untz... Untz-untz-untz so sweet!

14:54.870 --> 14:56.200
Ay, mustard on the beat.

14:56.530 --> 15:01.370
Y-You're the one 
making me happy, Kusuri-senpai!

15:01.370 --> 15:02.210
Allow me.

15:02.580 --> 15:04.840
Your acutely precise 
understanding of our needs...

15:05.500 --> 15:09.970
The massive amount of data 
you've collected to make us happy...

15:09.970 --> 15:11.970
Are you praising a good bot?

15:11.970 --> 15:19.060
<b>pat♥ pat♥</b>

15:11.970 --> 15:19.560
Attagirl!

15:12.590 --> 15:17.930
Your efficiency with the simultaneous 
headpats, despite logistical infeasibility...

15:17.930 --> 15:19.560
Ever heard of comedic exaggeration?

15:20.060 --> 15:20.850
Actually...

15:21.230 --> 15:25.610
I practice every night at home using self-made 
mannequins that simulate your heads.

15:25.610 --> 15:27.610
I forgot how seriously 
he takes being a boyfriend!

15:27.860 --> 15:31.740
I love you for all that 
and so much more, Aijo Rentaro.

15:32.160 --> 15:35.240
I'm always grateful 
for the happiness you bring me.

15:35.240 --> 15:36.330
Habu!

15:36.330 --> 15:37.330
Yoshiharu?

15:37.330 --> 15:37.990
I love you.

15:37.990 --> 15:38.870
Hanyu!

15:38.870 --> 15:39.750
Yuzuru?

15:40.380 --> 15:41.370
Same here.

15:41.790 --> 15:46.500
The amount of hard work you put into making 
your girlfriends happy always inspires me.

15:46.500 --> 15:52.130
And you still help me practice, even though 
that friendly game is done and dusted!

15:52.430 --> 15:54.390
She's talking about baseball, right?

15:54.390 --> 15:57.640
<b>tremble tremble</b>

15:54.390 --> 15:57.640
Duh. She's not your daughter.

15:57.970 --> 16:00.350
You're an amazing boyfriend, Rentaro.

16:00.890 --> 16:03.020
Thanks for all the joy you bring me.

16:03.020 --> 16:05.360
I love you loads too.

16:06.770 --> 16:09.860
Wha... Wh-What's going on today?

16:07.270 --> 16:07.860
<b>hug</b>

16:09.860 --> 16:11.320
Is this the day I die?

16:11.320 --> 16:13.110
<i>"You can't go dyin' on me."</i>

16:13.410 --> 16:15.870
<i>"You always let me sit on your lap...</i>

16:16.240 --> 16:17.780
<i>or on your shoulder..."</i>

16:17.780 --> 16:19.140
What are you, a mascot?

16:19.140 --> 16:21.120
And you're totally okay with this?!

16:21.630 --> 16:26.130
<i>"You are a truly gentle 
and kind person. And...</i>

16:26.130 --> 16:33.510
<i>Meeting you, my dear Rentaro, 
is my life's greatest treasure."</i>

16:34.660 --> 16:35.760
True.

16:36.130 --> 16:38.970
Rentaro-kun really is kind.

16:39.250 --> 16:40.220
That said,

16:40.500 --> 16:43.060
his hands are big and firm.

16:43.060 --> 16:44.730
His manly hands...

16:45.270 --> 16:47.480
They always pat me,

16:48.100 --> 16:49.730
hold me tight,

16:50.020 --> 16:53.860
and go to town on my breasts 
every single day, and I love them!

16:54.690 --> 16:57.150
The hell have you been doing?!

16:55.490 --> 16:57.150
I'm innocent!

16:57.150 --> 17:00.910
Oh no, I'm sorry! I blurted out my fantasies!

17:01.380 --> 17:02.410
I'm sorry.

17:02.850 --> 17:04.020
Please don't hate me!

17:04.020 --> 17:06.810
I'm sorry... That was in my dreams...

17:06.810 --> 17:09.720
Don't worry. It's not your fault.

17:09.720 --> 17:12.670
The only things wrong here are 
the manga writer and anime staff's brains.

17:14.150 --> 17:17.430
<i>His hands really are so big and gentle.</i>

17:17.760 --> 17:23.220
Being your girlfriend has made me 
the happiest girl in the world.

17:23.220 --> 17:25.560
I love you, Rentaro-kun.

17:28.730 --> 17:30.140
S-Sorry.

17:30.140 --> 17:34.190
Well, while I agree that it's wonderful 
how gentle and manly he can be,

17:34.590 --> 17:39.200
it's really lovely how cute 
he can be at times, too.

17:38.070 --> 17:39.200
<b>squish</b>

17:39.810 --> 17:40.950
What's more,

17:40.950 --> 17:43.250
he never complains when I stroke his head.

17:43.250 --> 17:45.460
How could I ever complain about this?

17:45.460 --> 17:48.370
I mean, Karane-chan started throwing hands.

17:48.370 --> 17:50.780
And all I did was try to lick her a little.

17:50.780 --> 17:52.840
Be prepared to risk your life next time.

17:53.160 --> 17:58.440
Thank you so much for being born 
into this world, Rentaro-chan.

17:58.440 --> 17:59.470
I love you.

18:00.730 --> 18:02.140
My, my.

18:02.140 --> 18:05.980
I believe that Rentaro-sama 
is a wonderful man, too.

18:06.500 --> 18:09.500
He has brought so much 
happiness to Hahari-sama.

18:09.500 --> 18:12.230
Are you sure you're in love with <i>him</i>?

18:12.690 --> 18:18.490
I am. Rentaro-sama taught me 
the joys of give-and-take.

18:18.900 --> 18:22.240
Allow me to one-sidedly massage your shoulders.

18:22.580 --> 18:24.240
Not on my watch.

18:24.240 --> 18:29.820
Before, I only felt guilt 
when people helped me.

18:24.240 --> 18:37.510
rub rub

18:26.830 --> 18:37.510
<b>The Battle of Shoulder-Massage</b>

18:29.820 --> 18:35.200
Now I feel warm and fuzzy in my heart 
when Rentaro-sama does it.

18:35.200 --> 18:37.510
Your words and flashback couldn't match less.

18:38.270 --> 18:40.010
I'm not sure I deserve it,

18:40.460 --> 18:45.890
but I dearly wish to be with you for 
many more days to come, Rentaro-sama.

18:53.260 --> 18:56.320
Being the subject of your dedication

18:56.320 --> 19:00.450
is proof of my beauty 
and my pride and joy as a person.

19:00.450 --> 19:02.410
M... Mimimi-senpai...

19:02.640 --> 19:06.370
If you ask me, your beautiful heart is...

19:06.370 --> 19:10.130
SSSSSSSSSSS-rank, indeed!

19:10.130 --> 19:13.670
I think your adventurer's guild 
has an issue with rank-creep.

19:14.210 --> 19:16.920
I love you so, Rentaro-kun.

19:16.920 --> 19:20.690
I will strive to live up 
to your delightful character

19:20.690 --> 19:23.680
by becoming more and more beautiful myself.

19:23.680 --> 19:27.180
Byubiful!

19:25.480 --> 19:27.180
