The lifestyle of a spy!

19:43.550 --> 19:45.660
You don't have to worry about that.

19:46.250 --> 19:49.410
Let's take it slow and steady, 
at a comfortable pace for you.

19:49.410 --> 19:49.950
After all...

19:50.400 --> 19:51.950
We're going to be together forever.

19:52.890 --> 19:56.250
Rentaro-kun, thank you for saying that.

