convenience store snacks...

20:42.040 --> 20:43.380
But more than anything,

20:43.910 --> 20:47.390
I feel so lucky to hear you say you l-lo...

20:47.810 --> 20:54.270
you love a girl like me, and I l-l-love 
you for that, Rentaro-senpai.

